  "title": "Vegetable Fried Rice",
  "description": "This vegetable fried rice is a quick dish that combines nutty brown rice with bell peppers, peas, and onions seasoned with sesame oil and soy sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "dakota kelly"
  ],
